            <div xml:id="d523">

                <pb facs="0833" n="817" sameAs="frus:frus1949v06/pg817"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Palestine/3–1149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Jerusalem</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Burdett</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jerusalem</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1949-03-11">March 11, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                <p>216. According to Palestine <hi rendition="#italic">Post</hi> Ben Gurion stated
                    in Assembly speech yesterday “Jerusalem was part of Jewish state, and there was
                    no difference between Jerusalem and other parts of Israel. World recognition
                    would be sought for this”.</p>
                <p>Repeated Beirut 28, Baghdad 12, Damascus 11, Amman 16, pouched Cairo, Jidda.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Burdett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
